1
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,480
Judging from the surveillance footage,

2
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,959
this was a premeditated kidnapping.

3
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,319
So far,

4
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,239
have we received any

5
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:58,680
ransom messages or calls regarding Professor Du?

6
00:01:59,799 --> 00:02:00,319
No.

7
00:02:01,239 --> 00:02:01,719
None.

8
00:02:01,799 --> 00:02:03,480
However, we have already identified

9
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,760
the two kidnappers.

10
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:07,719
They are both subordinates of Country M

11
00:02:07,719 --> 00:02:10,000
drug lords Piyazi and Xiang Dong.

12
00:02:10,199 --> 00:02:12,280
But as for Professor Du's exact whereabouts,

13
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:14,800
we haven't found anything yet.

14
00:02:14,919 --> 00:02:17,000
Rest assured, everyone.

15
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:20,400
We will solve this case swiftly.

16
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,280
The reason we asked you here

17
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:24,599
is mainly to have you tell us

18
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:26,039
a bit about Professor Du.

19
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:30,240
For example, what his daily habits are,

20
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:33,400
and whether he suffers from any illness.

21
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:36,759
These details could help our investigation.

22
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,000
We also know

23
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:42,599
that Piyazi has established

24
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:45,680
a drug distribution network in mainland China.

25
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:48,319
Is it possible Professor Du

26
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,560
had contact with Piyazi's people

27
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:56,159
before coming to Country M?

28
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,039
You don't seriously think

29
00:02:58,039 --> 00:02:59,680
an internationally renowned scientist

30
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,719
is tied to drug dealers, do you?

31
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:04,280
When Professor Du was taken hostage,

32
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:08,199
he never called out for help.

33
00:03:08,199 --> 00:03:09,719
If someone held two guns to your head,

34
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:11,240
I'm sure you wouldn't scream either.

35
00:03:11,319 --> 00:03:12,439
I understand your point.

36
00:03:12,919 --> 00:03:16,520
It's just that in our line of work,

37
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:20,080
we have to consider every possibility.

38
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:23,680
Before I came here,

39
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:26,120
I spoke in depth with Prof. Du's family.

40
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,719
He would never do

41
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:29,240
what you're suggesting.

42
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:31,120
So right now, our focus

43
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:31,919
should probably be on

44
00:03:31,919 --> 00:03:33,319
how to rescue Professor Du.

45
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,240
Officer Li,

46
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,560
regarding this matter,

47
00:03:36,719 --> 00:03:38,280
Country M's police take it very seriously.

48
00:03:38,599 --> 00:03:39,439
I'm sorry.

49
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,280
Please understand.

50
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,000
But as you know,

51
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:46,280
we're under immense pressure too.

52
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:51,360
We also want to crack this case as soon as possible.

53
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:59,439
As it involves international drug cartels,

54
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:01,120
Interpol

55
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,680
takes Professor Du's case very seriously.

56
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:08,680
Officer Li, I must remind you,

57
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,159
just like us,

58
00:04:10,879 --> 00:04:13,520
you lack investigative power in Country M.

59
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,000
Strictly speaking,

60
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:18,199
your assistance to Country M's police

61
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:21,279
is limited to sharing files and intel.

62
00:04:23,399 --> 00:04:24,879
I understand the international protocol.

63
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,839
Besides knowing that Professor Du

64
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:29,120
was kidnapped by Piyazi's crew,

65
00:04:29,319 --> 00:04:31,360
what else does Interpol know?

66
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:35,920
Professor Du traveled to Country M alone.

67
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:37,600
The seminar participants

68
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,399
know very little about

69
00:04:38,439 --> 00:04:40,240
Professor Du's actions around the time

70
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:41,120
of his disappearance.

71
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:43,160
Based on our assessment,

72
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:44,879
Professor Du was very likely

73
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:46,240
abducted by Piyazi

74
00:04:46,519 --> 00:04:48,439
to the drug lab in Jiechan State.

75
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,160
But without

76
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:51,800
sufficient evidence and leads,

77
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:54,800
Country M's police won't launch a rescue.

78
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,399
The Chinese government

79
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:04,639
will never watch its citizens in danger

80
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,040
and do nothing.

81
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:09,399
I was ordered to bring Professor Du home safely,

82
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:10,680
and I will fulfill my mission.

83
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:12,920
I'll report to Interpol headquarters

84
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,519
to include Professor Du's rescue

85
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:15,839
in the joint international operation

86
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:17,800
against Piyazi's crime syndicate.

87
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,920
Once we have Professor Du's whereabouts,

88
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,120
I'll urge Country M's police to take action.

89
00:05:22,279 --> 00:05:23,040
Thank you.

90
00:05:28,199 --> 00:05:30,079
I spoke with Professor Du's family.

91
00:05:31,279 --> 00:05:32,600
He's a man of absolute integrity.

92
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,279
I believe

93
00:05:33,519 --> 00:05:35,879
he'll never yield to Piyazi's force.

94
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,800
So we must hurry.

95
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,480
Because I'm worried

96
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:40,199
his life could be in danger at any moment.

97
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,720
What do you plan to do?

98
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,399
How can I

99
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:47,279
get in touch with Piyazi's men?

100
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:51,920
Piyazi has men in both Country M and Xilano.

101
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,920
They often hang around

102
00:05:53,959 --> 00:05:54,879
entertainment venues.

103
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,000
Tell you what,

104
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:58,199
I'll send their files

105
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,800
to your email, alright?

106
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:04,639
But I must remind you,

107
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,839
under any circumstances,

108
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:07,680
stay within your investigative authority.

109
00:06:08,079 --> 00:06:10,360
Never unlawfully carry or use firearms.

110
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,199
Understood.

111
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:27,279
What's wrong with you guys?

112
00:06:30,639 --> 00:06:31,279
What are you doing?

113
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:46,720
Don't kill me! Don't kill me!

114
00:06:46,759 --> 00:06:47,319
Li Qiang!

115
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:49,959
Don't kill him!

116
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:16,639
Get in.

117
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:19,879
Get in.

118
00:07:47,399 --> 00:07:48,959
He stopped the car to help us.

119
00:07:50,959 --> 00:07:52,079
Why did you hurt him?

120
00:07:52,399 --> 00:07:53,519
If he got suspicious,

121
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:54,560
we'd be in deep trouble.

122
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:57,639
Besides, we need money right now.

123
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:03,000
Have you always been like this?

124
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,240
For your own sake,

125
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:05,879
with no regard for anyone else's life?

126
00:08:10,959 --> 00:08:12,040
What matters most right now

127
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:14,040
is that we stay alive.

128
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:16,560
Don't worry.

129
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,680
Once we meet my big brother,

130
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,600
everything will be fine.

131
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,199
Can you promise me

132
00:08:28,519 --> 00:08:30,040
never to kill anyone again?

133
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,879
At least don't kill the innocent.

134
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,279
You're not even my woman.

135
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,440
What right do you have to make demands?

136
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:49,879
I promise you.

137
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,399
I know you hate me.

138
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:53,440
In your eyes,

139
00:08:53,559 --> 00:08:55,080
I'm just an unforgivable bastard.

140
00:08:55,399 --> 00:08:56,320
But I want to tell you,

141
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,799
I'm not who you think I am.

142
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,159
I hope

143
00:09:01,159 --> 00:09:03,120
we can give each other another chance

144
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,159
to get to know each other.

145
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:11,600
If in the end you still only hate me,

146
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,399
with no love left,

147
00:09:16,039 --> 00:09:18,120
at least I won't have any regrets.

148
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:27,639
Li Xiao,

149
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,360
can we start over?

150
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,080
This time,

151
00:09:35,679 --> 00:09:36,600
you're a cop,

152
00:09:38,799 --> 00:09:40,360
and I'm a coffee shop owner.

153
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,759
I know who you are,

154
00:09:46,039 --> 00:09:48,240
but I still want to be with you.

155
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,919
Actually, I've been torn, too.

156
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:07,080
Whenever I think about what I told you that day,

157
00:11:08,519 --> 00:11:11,399
I really feel like I was being selfish.

158
00:11:15,759 --> 00:11:17,360
Can we start over?

159
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,159
This time,

160
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,240
you're a cop,

161
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:25,080
and I run a coffee shop.

162
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,279
I know who you are,

163
00:11:30,519 --> 00:11:32,759
but I still want to be with you.

164
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,679
I thought since it's the weekend,

165
00:11:35,799 --> 00:11:36,919
we could spend some more time together.

166
00:11:37,279 --> 00:11:37,960
Turns out...

167
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:40,279
Come on.

168
00:11:40,399 --> 00:11:42,480
Do you think I'm that petty?

169
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,559
It's fine, go on.

170
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:46,799
Go on, go.

171
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,000
I'll head inside, then.

172
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:51,559
Go ahead.

173
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:28,639
Last year,

174
00:12:30,639 --> 00:12:32,279
when I came to Jiangyang,

175
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:35,240
I had a crew of brothers with me.

176
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:41,279
Now coming back,

177
00:12:41,879 --> 00:12:42,519
sitting here,

178
00:12:44,559 --> 00:12:46,159
I'm the only one left.

179
00:12:48,279 --> 00:12:49,840
My closest brothers...

180
00:12:51,679 --> 00:12:53,960
one has vanished without a trace,

181
00:12:54,799 --> 00:12:55,600
and the other

182
00:12:56,919 --> 00:12:58,320
died right here in Jiangyang.

183
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,399
You mean

184
00:13:08,759 --> 00:13:10,159
Li Qiang and Xiao Yunfei?

185
00:13:13,159 --> 00:13:14,279
They were just like you.

186
00:13:16,559 --> 00:13:18,799
We went through life and death together.

187
00:13:19,799 --> 00:13:20,639
Right now,

188
00:13:21,559 --> 00:13:23,600
my only wish is for Li Qiang to be

189
00:13:24,559 --> 00:13:25,399
safe

190
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,360
and sound.

191
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:34,799
You really value loyalty, don't you?

192
00:13:37,639 --> 00:13:39,679
I've hurt a lot of people.

193
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,159
Some of them

194
00:13:41,879 --> 00:13:43,200
had no grudge against me.

195
00:13:43,399 --> 00:13:46,000
I didn't even know

196
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:46,759
their names.

197
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:51,440
But brothers who faced life and death with me are different.

198
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:56,279
Brothers are family.

199
00:13:59,799 --> 00:14:01,159
Family never betrays.

200
00:14:07,879 --> 00:14:08,639
To family.

201
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:29,759
You're back.

202
00:14:37,519 --> 00:14:39,200
You talked with Ma Jingrong for so long today.

203
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:40,440
Did you find out anything?

204
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:42,559
He wants me tomorrow

205
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:44,240
to go with him to meet his old downlines.

206
00:14:44,559 --> 00:14:47,159
We'll use them to find his old major clients.

207
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,200
Once that's done,

208
00:14:49,279 --> 00:14:51,840
we can report back to Theerade.

209
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:56,320
What are you doing?

210
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:57,919
Don't move.

211
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:01,200
Does it look good?

212
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:03,279
It looks good.

213
00:15:06,879 --> 00:15:07,480
Wait,

214
00:15:09,039 --> 00:15:09,799
Comrade Ge Dan,

215
00:15:10,039 --> 00:15:11,320
we're here on a mission,

216
00:15:11,639 --> 00:15:12,600
not on vacation.

217
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:15,600
Can't you be a little sweeter?

218
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,679
Do you know what today is?

219
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:19,639
Your birthday.

220
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:22,799
You remembered?

221
00:15:24,039 --> 00:15:25,159
When women ask that,

222
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:26,960
it's either a birthday or an anniversary.

223
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,000
If I didn't know that,

224
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:28,960
how could I play your husband?

225
00:15:31,799 --> 00:15:32,799
You're no fun.

226
00:15:43,679 --> 00:15:44,320
Wait for me a second.

227
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:46,840
Don't come over unless I call you!

228
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:10,720
I saw it!

229
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:12,799
I saw everything.

230
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:14,519
Move your hand, let me see.

231
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:16,399
I haven't even called you over yet.

232
00:16:20,799 --> 00:16:21,840
Even the year I was born,

233
00:16:21,919 --> 00:16:23,120
you remember so clearly.

234
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:24,840
You're so sweet.

235
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:26,480
Just the birthday?

236
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:27,399
Look again.

237
00:16:31,039 --> 00:16:32,639
This is...

238
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,480
You don't even remember this?

239
00:16:38,559 --> 00:16:39,120
This is the day

240
00:16:39,159 --> 00:16:40,720
we first met at the police academy.

241
00:16:40,919 --> 00:16:42,240
How did you even become a cop?

242
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,120
Give it to me.

243
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:55,519
A birthday present.

244
00:16:57,279 --> 00:16:58,039
For me?

245
00:17:04,279 --> 00:17:05,160
Happy birthday.

246
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:07,759
Thank you.

247
00:17:10,039 --> 00:17:10,920
This necklace

248
00:17:12,359 --> 00:17:13,519
symbolizes protection.

249
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,720
No matter what happens in the future,

250
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:19,880
I want you to be safe

251
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:21,720
and sound.

252
00:17:35,119 --> 00:17:35,799
Come in.

253
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:36,759
Chief.

254
00:17:37,279 --> 00:17:39,359
The people from the Provincial Department and Nanhai Bureau are here.

255
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:41,599
Please show them to the conference room.

256
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:42,160
Yes, sir.

257
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:52,599
Starting now,

258
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,799
you must fully cooperate with the Nanhai police

259
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,359
on this special operation.

260
00:18:00,480 --> 00:18:01,640
Follow me to the conference room.

261
00:18:07,079 --> 00:18:09,079
Over the past year, Cheng Weimin

262
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:09,839
has become

263
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:12,039
the biggest drug trafficker in Jiangyang.

264
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:14,519
After Zhongtian Logistics and Xinghai International

265
00:18:14,519 --> 00:18:15,640
came under investigation,

266
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:17,400
Cheng Weimin went missing.

267
00:18:17,759 --> 00:18:19,200
However, according to our investigation,

268
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,119
not only did Cheng Weimin not flee

269
00:18:21,119 --> 00:18:22,480
as we had expected,

270
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:23,799
he remains lying low in our city,

271
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:24,880
continuing his drug trafficking activities.

272
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:26,640
The night before last,

273
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:29,359
we moved to arrest Yang Xing,

274
00:18:29,799 --> 00:18:30,759
but unexpectedly ran into

275
00:18:30,799 --> 00:18:32,000
Piyazi's younger brother, Xiang Nan.

276
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:34,839
Just as we were tracking down Xiang Nan

277
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:36,079
and his accomplices,

278
00:18:36,319 --> 00:18:37,519
I received a call from Chief Yan.

279
00:18:39,599 --> 00:18:41,519
I received a call from Chief Zhou Xianyang

280
00:18:41,519 --> 00:18:43,279
of the Guangnan Provincial Department,

281
00:18:43,279 --> 00:18:44,559
so I had Chief Yan

282
00:18:44,559 --> 00:18:46,319
issue an emergency order to you.

283
00:18:49,599 --> 00:18:50,119
Captain Bai,

284
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:53,000
please brief everyone on the latest progress

285
00:18:53,119 --> 00:18:54,000
of Operation Thunderbolt.

286
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:54,880
Yes, sir.

287
00:18:58,720 --> 00:18:59,720
Operation Thunderbolt

288
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,119
is conducted by our Nanhai police

289
00:19:01,279 --> 00:19:02,640
under the deployment of the Provincial Department,

290
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:05,559
alongside Interpol and Country M's police,

291
00:19:05,559 --> 00:19:07,720
targeting Piyazi and Theerade,

292
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:09,400
the two major international drug syndicates,

293
00:19:09,559 --> 00:19:12,000
in a joint anti-drug campaign.

294
00:19:12,519 --> 00:19:14,559
Currently, we have largely mapped out

295
00:19:14,599 --> 00:19:15,720
their organizational structure,

296
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:18,680
and two officers have successfully infiltrated them.

297
00:19:20,279 --> 00:19:21,400
The night of your raid,

298
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:22,519
our undercover officer

299
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:23,759
was making contact with Xiang Nan.

300
00:19:24,079 --> 00:19:26,400
To keep Operation Thunderbolt on track,

301
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:28,400
I urgently consulted Chief Zhou Xianyang

302
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:30,440
to suspend your operation.

303
00:19:30,519 --> 00:19:32,119
I deeply apologize for that.

304
00:19:32,799 --> 00:19:33,480
Of course,

305
00:19:33,839 --> 00:19:35,640
we also hope to have your bureau's full support

306
00:19:35,799 --> 00:19:37,119
in our future operations.

307
00:19:39,279 --> 00:19:40,680
All right, Captain Bai, please take a seat.

308
00:19:45,079 --> 00:19:45,599
Captain Bai,

309
00:19:46,160 --> 00:19:48,519
how exactly do you need us to assist you?

310
00:19:49,599 --> 00:19:51,960
Our superiors sent Comrade Bai Hua here

311
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:56,079
to ensure that all units and departments

312
00:19:56,319 --> 00:19:58,599
can coordinate more effectively

313
00:19:58,799 --> 00:20:00,839
for the success of Operation Thunderbolt.

314
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:04,079
Our two undercover officers,

315
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:05,519
are they both in contact now?

316
00:20:07,119 --> 00:20:08,519
Not the one beside Xiang Nan yet.

317
00:20:08,599 --> 00:20:09,680
However, the other one

318
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:12,240
has already arrived in Jiangyang with Ma Jingrong.

319
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:15,440
Ma Jingrong's purpose on this trip

320
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:17,920
is to find bigger buyers for Theerade.

321
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:19,000
I believe

322
00:20:19,039 --> 00:20:20,720
once it's safe for them to act,

323
00:20:20,759 --> 00:20:22,079
they'll contact me right away.

324
00:20:26,079 --> 00:20:27,839
Communication is crucial.

325
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:31,440
It's also the key to ensuring the success of our operation.

326
00:20:31,799 --> 00:20:34,039
As chief liaison officer, Captain Bai,

327
00:20:34,079 --> 00:20:36,400
you must keep our lines of communication open.

328
00:20:36,519 --> 00:20:37,599
In field operations,

329
00:20:38,039 --> 00:20:39,400
our undercover officers

330
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,480
may occasionally lose contact

331
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:42,359
due to unforeseen circumstances.

332
00:20:42,799 --> 00:20:44,160
If that happens,

333
00:20:44,319 --> 00:20:46,599
Captain Bai, you must notify us promptly

334
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:48,920
so we can address emergencies

335
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:50,279
and take immediate action.

336
00:20:50,839 --> 00:20:51,319
Understood.

337
00:20:51,799 --> 00:20:53,119
Chief Yan is absolutely right.

338
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:54,720
The Jiangyang Anti-Drug Brigade's

339
00:20:54,720 --> 00:20:56,440
primary mission right now

340
00:20:56,759 --> 00:20:59,240
is to assist the two undercover officers

341
00:20:59,599 --> 00:21:01,319
in penetrating deeper into

342
00:21:01,559 --> 00:21:02,880
the cartel's inner circle.

343
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:05,559
Meanwhile, based on the intel they provide,

344
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:07,200
we must crack down hard on

345
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:09,640
drug crimes hidden in Jiangyang.

346
00:21:10,079 --> 00:21:11,000
Starting now,

347
00:21:11,279 --> 00:21:13,599
you will fully cooperate with the Nanhai police,

348
00:21:13,759 --> 00:21:16,759
to take on international drug cartels

349
00:21:16,839 --> 00:21:17,960
as your special mission.

350
00:21:19,559 --> 00:21:20,720
Rest assured, commanders.

351
00:21:20,720 --> 00:21:22,039
We will accomplish the mission!

352
00:21:39,160 --> 00:21:39,799
Good stuff.

353
00:21:40,839 --> 00:21:42,519
Boss Ma, long time no see.

354
00:21:42,559 --> 00:21:44,279
Your quality has definitely leveled up.

355
00:21:46,319 --> 00:21:47,400
For stuff like this,

356
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:49,519
I'll take whatever you have, Boss Ma.

357
00:21:51,039 --> 00:21:52,000
For this pack,

358
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:54,599
I can give it to you at our old price.

359
00:21:55,319 --> 00:21:56,440
The rest is open for discussion.

360
00:21:57,759 --> 00:21:59,240
My trip to Jiangyang this time...

361
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:00,720
is mainly because...

362
00:22:01,240 --> 00:22:02,000
I want to find a few...

363
00:22:02,119 --> 00:22:04,359
big clients for long-term cooperation.

364
00:22:06,119 --> 00:22:08,200
So it seems small buyers like us...

365
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:09,039
won't have a chance...

366
00:22:09,039 --> 00:22:11,759
to make a fortune with Boss Ma anymore?

367
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:14,359
Don't say that.

368
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:18,039
If you can help me find the right clients,

369
00:22:18,279 --> 00:22:21,279
consider this pack a gift between friends.

370
00:22:23,279 --> 00:22:25,440
Looks like Boss Ma is really aiming big.

371
00:22:26,599 --> 00:22:28,599
Boss Ma, you have no idea.

372
00:22:29,359 --> 00:22:30,680
These past few months,

373
00:22:31,079 --> 00:22:33,079
Jiangyang police's anti-drug operations...

374
00:22:33,599 --> 00:22:35,240
haven't stopped for a second.

375
00:22:36,359 --> 00:22:37,799
A lot of my old friends...

376
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:40,079
have been busted by the cops.

377
00:22:42,319 --> 00:22:44,000
With the heat this intense right now,

378
00:22:44,279 --> 00:22:47,039
who'd dare take in such massive shipments?

379
00:22:50,039 --> 00:22:50,640
I know.

380
00:22:51,119 --> 00:22:52,119
In our line of work,

381
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:53,119
one slip-up...

382
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:55,559
and we all know the consequences.

383
00:22:57,519 --> 00:22:58,440
That's why...

384
00:22:58,440 --> 00:23:01,319
instead of sneaking around doing petty deals,

385
00:23:01,359 --> 00:23:04,799
we might as well pull off a few big ones.

386
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:07,640
Are you interested?

387
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:09,119
Bring your crew,

388
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:11,319
and let's do some big deals together.

389
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:16,200
Since Boss Ma thinks so highly of me,

390
00:23:16,240 --> 00:23:17,880
I'd be honored to oblige.

391
00:23:20,559 --> 00:23:21,839
But right now,

392
00:23:22,599 --> 00:23:23,680
in Jiangyang,

393
00:23:23,720 --> 00:23:26,519
anyone with the clout to work with Boss Ma...

394
00:23:27,839 --> 00:23:29,759
there really aren't many.

395
00:23:33,519 --> 00:23:34,160
How about this?

396
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:35,359
Let me introduce someone to you.

397
00:23:36,319 --> 00:23:37,960
Have you ever heard of...

398
00:23:39,799 --> 00:23:41,640
a guy named Cheng Weimin?

399
00:23:44,119 --> 00:23:45,039
Cheng Weimin?

400
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:48,799
Two years ago, his men bought from me.

401
00:23:49,279 --> 00:23:51,599
But he didn't deal in such large volumes.

402
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:53,400
You said it yourself.

403
00:23:53,759 --> 00:23:55,119
That was two years ago.

404
00:23:55,319 --> 00:23:57,880
Now, this guy plays in the big leagues.

405
00:24:01,319 --> 00:24:01,839
I know that.

406
00:24:01,839 --> 00:24:04,559
He's partnered with several bosses in the mainland.

407
00:24:07,319 --> 00:24:08,440
In a few months, we move...

408
00:24:08,759 --> 00:24:12,000
barely a dozen or so kilos.

409
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:13,759
But on his end,

410
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:16,960
they count it in tons.

411
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:20,759
Do you know where he gets his supply?

412
00:24:22,119 --> 00:24:23,480
That, I wouldn't know.

413
00:24:24,519 --> 00:24:25,839
I just get the feeling...

414
00:24:25,880 --> 00:24:27,599
he's never run out of goods.

415
00:24:28,400 --> 00:24:29,880
But a while ago,

416
00:24:30,759 --> 00:24:33,000
his supplier seemed to run into trouble.

417
00:24:34,359 --> 00:24:36,039
Last week, when I went to get goods from him,

418
00:24:36,559 --> 00:24:38,759
he told me I had to wait a while.

419
00:24:42,279 --> 00:24:44,400
He has the clients, and I have the supply.

420
00:24:45,599 --> 00:24:47,000
This deal can work.

421
00:24:47,359 --> 00:24:49,000
Since Boss Ma is so interested,

422
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:51,000
I'll do you a favor...

423
00:24:51,200 --> 00:24:53,759
and introduce the two of you.

424
00:24:54,119 --> 00:24:55,559
Sounds good. Set up a meeting.

425
00:24:55,599 --> 00:24:56,079
Alright.

426
00:25:08,480 --> 00:25:09,079
Brother Nan,

427
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:12,160
Cheng Weimin hasn't been in touch lately.

428
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:15,720
Why don't we head back to Country M first?

429
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:17,079
Once we're back, we'll be safe.

430
00:25:17,680 --> 00:25:19,799
Cheng Weimin got three of my brothers killed.

431
00:25:20,519 --> 00:25:22,119
There's no way in hell I'm letting him off.

432
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:27,720
Let me tell you one more time.

433
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:30,480
He has plenty of my client information.

434
00:25:30,720 --> 00:25:31,759
If I don't deal with him,

435
00:25:31,759 --> 00:25:33,599
how am I supposed to face the boss?

436
00:25:34,559 --> 00:25:36,240
I heard Cheng Weimin recently

437
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,599
recruited quite a few men.

438
00:25:37,920 --> 00:25:38,599
And there are only...

439
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:40,519
three of us.

440
00:25:41,880 --> 00:25:42,559
Scared?

441
00:25:44,400 --> 00:25:46,359
People call you Four-Legged Snake.

442
00:25:47,079 --> 00:25:49,480
Don't tell me you're really like one,

443
00:25:49,480 --> 00:25:52,039
dropping your tail and running when trouble hits?

444
00:25:52,359 --> 00:25:53,079
Brother Nan,

445
00:25:53,720 --> 00:25:55,480
am I really that kind of person?

446
00:26:03,119 --> 00:26:06,880
Fine. Whatever you order, we'll do.

447
00:26:09,720 --> 00:26:11,200
Keep an eye on Yang Xing.

448
00:26:13,279 --> 00:26:14,519
Akai, come with me.

449
00:26:30,839 --> 00:26:31,519
Brother Nan.

450
00:26:34,240 --> 00:26:35,400
Long time no see.

451
00:26:35,799 --> 00:26:36,799
Long time no see.

452
00:26:37,039 --> 00:26:37,599
How are things?

453
00:26:37,720 --> 00:26:38,960
Where's the stuff I asked for?

454
00:26:39,559 --> 00:26:40,519
It's been ready for a while.

455
00:27:12,559 --> 00:27:13,359
That's a lot.

456
00:27:15,880 --> 00:27:16,599
Brother Nan,

457
00:27:17,680 --> 00:27:18,640
what's this supposed to mean?

458
00:27:19,599 --> 00:27:20,880
This extra 500,000...

459
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:22,640
...is for a favor.

460
00:27:25,720 --> 00:27:27,119
I'm not quite following.

461
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:33,799
You see,

462
00:27:34,200 --> 00:27:35,960
a few friends are arriving in a couple of days.

463
00:27:36,559 --> 00:27:39,359
I need you and the boys to lend a hand.

464
00:27:41,359 --> 00:27:42,680
You want me to kill someone.

465
00:27:43,200 --> 00:27:44,000
500,000.

466
00:27:44,799 --> 00:27:46,240
The 500,000 is just a deposit.

467
00:27:46,519 --> 00:27:48,839
When have I ever shortchanged you?

468
00:27:49,359 --> 00:27:49,920
What do you say?

469
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:54,359
Fine. Call me before you make a move.

470
00:27:54,880 --> 00:27:55,359
That's what I like to hear.

471
00:27:55,480 --> 00:27:56,000
I'm out.

472
00:29:10,880 --> 00:29:12,440
That's 2.75 million in total.

473
00:29:12,880 --> 00:29:13,559
Even if we add

474
00:29:13,559 --> 00:29:15,440
what the other bosses owe us,

475
00:29:16,039 --> 00:29:17,000
our revenue this month

476
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:19,000
is still far less than previous months.

477
00:29:29,599 --> 00:29:30,759
Our Heroin No. 13

478
00:29:30,839 --> 00:29:32,240
has been out of stock for two months.

479
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:33,880
And by next month,

480
00:29:34,279 --> 00:29:36,319
Psychedelic Blues will basically be gone too.

481
00:29:37,440 --> 00:29:38,279
If by that time

482
00:29:38,279 --> 00:29:39,640
we still haven't found a supplier,

483
00:29:41,119 --> 00:29:42,519
our major clients

484
00:29:43,079 --> 00:29:45,400
might turn to other sellers.

485
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:47,599
What?

486
00:29:48,680 --> 00:29:50,279
Haven't we made enough money?

487
00:29:51,200 --> 00:29:52,200
How much longer do you want to do this?

488
00:29:52,759 --> 00:29:54,559
All this money we've made

489
00:29:54,960 --> 00:29:56,160
is only enough to buy

490
00:29:56,160 --> 00:29:57,440
a single condo in Las Vegas.

491
00:29:58,559 --> 00:30:00,279
We've worked so hard for so long

492
00:30:00,559 --> 00:30:02,000
and built up so many clients.

493
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,759
Why not make a little more?

494
00:30:09,079 --> 00:30:11,519
The cops are looking everywhere for me,

495
00:30:14,119 --> 00:30:16,559
and Piyazi won't let me off either.

496
00:30:17,960 --> 00:30:19,920
You don't care about your husband at all.

497
00:30:20,359 --> 00:30:21,880
All you see is money.

498
00:30:23,160 --> 00:30:24,720
What did I do wrong in my past life

499
00:30:24,839 --> 00:30:26,359
to end up with a woman like you?

500
00:30:33,680 --> 00:30:35,599
Behind every successful man,

501
00:30:35,599 --> 00:30:37,319
there must be a successful woman.

502
00:30:38,559 --> 00:30:39,920
One day,

503
00:30:40,200 --> 00:30:42,079
when you reach the pinnacle of your life,

504
00:30:43,079 --> 00:30:44,559
you'll definitely thank me for today.

505
00:30:45,160 --> 00:30:46,039
All right, enough.

506
00:30:47,119 --> 00:30:49,039
Stop going to those success seminars.

507
00:30:50,519 --> 00:30:51,799
What pinnacle of life?

508
00:30:52,920 --> 00:30:54,759
What business do you think we're in?

509
00:30:55,759 --> 00:30:57,440
Does the business even matter?

510
00:30:57,960 --> 00:30:59,759
The main thing is making money,

511
00:31:00,279 --> 00:31:00,920
isn't it?

512
00:31:02,559 --> 00:31:03,759
Honestly, woman,

513
00:31:04,759 --> 00:31:06,319
I really don't know what to say to you.

514
00:31:11,559 --> 00:31:12,079
Come in.

515
00:31:14,880 --> 00:31:15,359
Brother Min.

516
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:17,759
Well? What did you find out?

517
00:31:17,880 --> 00:31:18,720
Three days ago,

518
00:31:18,880 --> 00:31:20,160
men claiming to be cops

519
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:21,319
took Yang Xing from the club.

520
00:31:21,839 --> 00:31:23,119
But the strange thing is,

521
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,559
as soon as they left the club,

522
00:31:24,559 --> 00:31:25,680
the police ambushed them.

523
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:27,480
I heard there was even a firefight.

524
00:31:28,839 --> 00:31:30,400
Cops ambushing cops?

525
00:31:31,839 --> 00:31:32,640
You may go.

526
00:31:32,799 --> 00:31:33,400
Yes, sir.

527
00:31:38,359 --> 00:31:39,119
It's obvious.

528
00:31:40,039 --> 00:31:41,720
They weren't real cops.

529
00:31:55,160 --> 00:31:56,839
If I'm not mistaken,

530
00:31:57,680 --> 00:32:00,319
these guys aren't after Yang Xing.

531
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:03,200
They're after me, Cheng Weimin.

532
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:05,960
What are you talking about?

533
00:32:06,799 --> 00:32:08,079
I knew it.

534
00:32:09,559 --> 00:32:13,200
This mad dog won't let me go.

535
00:32:19,680 --> 00:32:20,519
Brother, want a paper?

536
00:32:20,640 --> 00:32:21,119
No.

537
00:32:21,519 --> 00:32:22,799
Brother, please, help me out.

538
00:32:22,880 --> 00:32:24,079
Times are tough. Buy one, please.

539
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:30,480
Keep the change.

540
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:33,000
Brother! Brother! The paper! The paper!

541
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:37,480
Brother Nan.

542
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:55,680
Boss, boss!

543
00:32:57,240 --> 00:32:57,599
Boss!

544
00:32:57,839 --> 00:32:58,400
Don't move!

545
00:33:03,039 --> 00:33:04,400
Boss, we can talk this out!

546
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:14,519
A grown man selling newspapers, huh?

547
00:33:37,279 --> 00:33:38,160
Drive, let's go.

548
00:34:09,559 --> 00:34:11,000
It's not that I don't trust you.

549
00:34:12,880 --> 00:34:14,599
It's just that after being in this business so long,

550
00:34:15,559 --> 00:34:17,360
some habits die hard.

551
00:34:18,599 --> 00:34:19,199
I know.

552
00:34:23,719 --> 00:34:25,400
Have you ever been to Country M?

553
00:34:26,519 --> 00:34:27,400
In all my life,

554
00:34:27,599 --> 00:34:28,599
I've never even been abroad.

555
00:34:28,840 --> 00:34:30,519
You said you were in the special forces.

556
00:34:30,719 --> 00:34:32,320
Never fought in combat on the border?

557
00:34:33,519 --> 00:34:34,559
It was peacetime.

558
00:34:34,679 --> 00:34:36,079
Not every special forces soldier

559
00:34:36,280 --> 00:34:38,199
gets the chance to see real combat.

560
00:34:38,199 --> 00:34:40,320
Years in the military and never killed anyone...

561
00:34:40,920 --> 00:34:42,280
Don't you feel you missed out?

562
00:34:42,960 --> 00:34:43,639
Not really.

563
00:34:44,360 --> 00:34:45,239
I only enlisted

564
00:34:45,480 --> 00:34:47,280
so I could get a good job later on.

565
00:34:47,440 --> 00:34:49,519
Who knew I'd get into drunken brawls in the army,

566
00:34:49,679 --> 00:34:50,639
get slapped with a major demerit,

567
00:34:51,079 --> 00:34:52,440
and get discharged early.

568
00:34:52,920 --> 00:34:54,679
Sounds like you're practically a deserter.

569
00:34:56,360 --> 00:34:57,159
Doesn't matter.

570
00:34:57,400 --> 00:34:58,880
Stick with me and work hard from now on.

571
00:34:59,199 --> 00:35:00,840
You'll definitely make it big.

572
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:02,280
Since you think so highly of me, Brother Nan,

573
00:35:02,880 --> 00:35:04,159
I'll give it everything I've got.

574
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:05,639
Do you have the guts to kill someone?

575
00:35:13,280 --> 00:35:14,360
Cheng Weimin.

576
00:35:16,760 --> 00:35:19,199
Cheng Weimin knows too much about our business.

577
00:35:20,599 --> 00:35:21,800
If we don't take him out,

578
00:35:22,599 --> 00:35:25,199
all our transit lines will soon be exposed.

579
00:35:27,599 --> 00:35:29,159
I heard from Brother Four

580
00:35:29,400 --> 00:35:30,400
that Cheng Weimin only went on the run

581
00:35:30,480 --> 00:35:32,559
because the cops seized the goods

582
00:35:32,639 --> 00:35:33,480
from Zhongtian Logistics.

583
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:35,559
If we kill him just over that,

584
00:35:35,920 --> 00:35:37,440
won't the other boys have second thoughts?

585
00:35:37,719 --> 00:35:39,000
In our line of work,

586
00:35:39,360 --> 00:35:41,360
there's no room for any mistakes.

587
00:35:41,519 --> 00:35:43,480
We can't keep one man alive

588
00:35:43,519 --> 00:35:44,920
and drag down the rest of our brothers.

589
00:35:45,519 --> 00:35:46,360
Besides,

590
00:35:47,280 --> 00:35:48,639
even if we don't do it,

591
00:35:48,840 --> 00:35:51,079
he won't fare well if the cops catch him.

592
00:35:51,920 --> 00:35:53,880
Kid, remember this:

593
00:35:54,039 --> 00:35:56,440
whatever you do in our line of work,

594
00:35:57,159 --> 00:35:59,320
you have to leave no loose ends.

595
00:36:01,159 --> 00:36:03,440
But the cops have already tracked down Yang Xing.

596
00:36:04,119 --> 00:36:05,840
Could they follow that lead

597
00:36:06,039 --> 00:36:07,119
and find Cheng Weimin?

598
00:36:08,440 --> 00:36:09,239
Not likely.

599
00:36:11,199 --> 00:36:12,360
I dug into him for so long

600
00:36:12,599 --> 00:36:13,880
before I finally got a lead.

601
00:36:14,159 --> 00:36:16,559
Those cops aren't that smart.

602
00:36:18,320 --> 00:36:19,599
Still, you've got a point.

603
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:21,639
We need to make our move quickly.

604
00:36:25,920 --> 00:36:27,519
You haven't answered me yet.

605
00:36:27,519 --> 00:36:28,960
Do you have the guts to kill?

606
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:36,559
I don't like killing.

607
00:36:37,079 --> 00:36:39,400
But if you insist on it, Brother Nan,

608
00:36:39,960 --> 00:36:41,039
all I can say is

609
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:44,000
Cheng Weimin won't be my first kill.

610
00:36:44,719 --> 00:36:46,039
So you've done it before.

611
00:36:47,960 --> 00:36:49,320
Back when I was in Nanhai,

612
00:36:49,679 --> 00:36:51,119
the boss I worked for was Liang Wenbiao.

613
00:36:51,320 --> 00:36:53,280
There was an undercover cop working under him,

614
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:54,880
and I took him out.

615
00:36:58,639 --> 00:37:00,599
You even had the guts to kill a cop?

616
00:37:01,880 --> 00:37:03,159
My hand was forced.

617
00:37:03,719 --> 00:37:05,880
Killing someone is never an easy thing.

618
00:37:07,800 --> 00:37:08,519
Good.

619
00:37:09,800 --> 00:37:11,000
Take out Cheng Weimin,

620
00:37:11,559 --> 00:37:13,400
and when we get back, I'll have the big boss reward you well.

621
00:37:14,320 --> 00:37:15,039
Thanks, Brother Nan.

622
00:37:15,280 --> 00:37:17,159
I'm truly backed into a corner right now.

623
00:37:18,400 --> 00:37:19,880
I'll stick with you and do whatever it takes.

624
00:37:39,639 --> 00:37:40,679
Going by what you're saying,

625
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:41,960
shouldn't we find a chance

626
00:37:41,960 --> 00:37:43,320
to clear things up with Xiang Nan?

627
00:37:45,559 --> 00:37:47,639
We've sold almost all his stash.

628
00:37:48,320 --> 00:37:49,480
Clear what up?

629
00:37:50,320 --> 00:37:51,079
Are you really willing

630
00:37:51,159 --> 00:37:53,039
to hand over all the money from these past months?

631
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:57,159
Even if we handed the cash over to him,

632
00:37:57,559 --> 00:37:59,480
he still wouldn't let us off the hook.

633
00:38:00,559 --> 00:38:01,679
Zhongtian Logistics—

634
00:38:01,960 --> 00:38:04,840
such a vital route went down on my watch.

635
00:38:06,519 --> 00:38:08,559
Piyazi won't just let this go.

636
00:38:09,320 --> 00:38:11,800
What happened to Zhongtian Logistics wasn't your fault.

637
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:13,519
Why should they hold you accountable?

638
00:38:17,320 --> 00:38:18,599
You don't know them.

639
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:20,119
When it comes to profit,

640
00:38:20,639 --> 00:38:22,039
they're capable of anything.

641
00:38:23,760 --> 00:38:25,400
Things have already come to this.

642
00:38:25,559 --> 00:38:26,719
Overthinking it won't help.

643
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:27,920
I don't believe

644
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:29,800
they could ever track me down here.

645
00:38:31,800 --> 00:38:33,639
You never know.

646
00:38:33,719 --> 00:38:37,440
We'll have to face this hurdle sooner or later.

647
00:38:50,320 --> 00:38:53,760
Instead of just waiting to be slaughtered,

648
00:38:55,440 --> 00:38:57,000
we should make the first move.

649
00:39:05,480 --> 00:39:06,000
Come in.

650
00:39:12,639 --> 00:39:13,480
Brother Min, Sister Min.

651
00:39:14,199 --> 00:39:15,199
Mr. Chang just called.

652
00:39:15,239 --> 00:39:16,719
He said he wants to introduce a seller to us.

653
00:39:18,480 --> 00:39:19,159
Chang Zai?

654
00:39:19,760 --> 00:39:21,159
Introduce a seller to me?

655
00:39:21,400 --> 00:39:22,519
Did you hear that right?

656
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:24,679
He still gets his supply from me.

657
00:39:24,679 --> 00:39:25,280
Mr. Chang said

658
00:39:25,280 --> 00:39:27,000
he's introducing someone named Mr. Ma,

659
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:29,440
and that he gets goods straight from Jiechan State.

660
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:31,440
He said we can get as much as we want.

661
00:39:34,440 --> 00:39:35,719
Mr. Ma?

662
00:39:38,920 --> 00:39:39,920
Jiechan State...

663
00:39:42,519 --> 00:39:43,760
Did you ask

664
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:45,760
what this Mr. Ma's full name is?

665
00:39:46,079 --> 00:39:47,679
I asked. They said it's Ma Jingrong.

666
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:49,320
Ma Jingrong.

667
00:39:56,119 --> 00:39:57,960
This Mr. Cheng...

668
00:39:58,400 --> 00:40:00,079
When is he going to show up?

669
00:40:01,199 --> 00:40:03,079
Mr. Ma, don't worry.

670
00:40:03,880 --> 00:40:05,119
The way this guy operates,

671
00:40:05,320 --> 00:40:06,920
he's always extremely cautious.

672
00:40:07,400 --> 00:40:08,599
You're lucky to have me.

673
00:40:09,400 --> 00:40:10,480
With anyone else,

674
00:40:10,639 --> 00:40:12,000
you wouldn't even catch a glimpse of him.

675
00:40:14,639 --> 00:40:15,400
He's calling.

676
00:40:18,199 --> 00:40:18,840
Boss Cheng.

677
00:40:19,480 --> 00:40:20,239
Look out the window.

678
00:40:23,119 --> 00:40:23,880
Follow me.

679
00:40:24,840 --> 00:40:26,239
All right, see you in a bit.

680
00:40:26,599 --> 00:40:27,400
Come on, follow him.

681
00:41:11,320 --> 00:41:12,039
Boss Cheng.

682
00:41:14,119 --> 00:41:15,039
And this is

683
00:41:15,360 --> 00:41:16,800
the one I told you about,

684
00:41:16,800 --> 00:41:18,440
Mr. Ma Jingrong.

685
00:41:20,119 --> 00:41:20,880
Hello, Mr. Cheng.

686
00:41:21,360 --> 00:41:22,119
Hello, Mr. Ma.

687
00:41:22,679 --> 00:41:23,159
Xiao Zhuang.

688
00:41:24,519 --> 00:41:25,239
Hello, Mr. Cheng.

689
00:41:25,960 --> 00:41:27,880
So you're Ma Jingrong.

690
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:32,280
Could I speak with Brother Ma in private?

691
00:41:32,480 --> 00:41:33,639
Sure, I'll leave you two to talk.

692
00:41:35,239 --> 00:41:36,000
After you, Mr. Ma.

693
00:41:48,840 --> 00:41:49,639
So you mean...

694
00:41:51,360 --> 00:41:53,519
Piyazi has long wanted to replace me.

695
00:41:54,960 --> 00:41:57,119
He sent Four-Legged Snake to Nanhai City

696
00:41:57,599 --> 00:41:59,840
just to wipe out your crew.

697
00:42:03,039 --> 00:42:05,159
I never believed in

698
00:42:05,159 --> 00:42:07,719
their so-called underworld loyalty.

699
00:42:08,079 --> 00:42:09,599
So the moment I learned

700
00:42:09,599 --> 00:42:12,119
the shipment to Nanhai went wrong,

701
00:42:12,280 --> 00:42:13,880
I went into hiding immediately.

702
00:42:16,320 --> 00:42:17,880
If I end up in the cops' hands,

703
00:42:18,400 --> 00:42:20,480
at worst, I could cooperate for a suspended death sentence.

704
00:42:21,480 --> 00:42:23,639
But if Piyazi gets his hands on me,

705
00:42:23,880 --> 00:42:25,519
it's certain death.

706
00:42:28,400 --> 00:42:31,519
The two of us are in the same boat now.

707
00:42:32,840 --> 00:42:34,440
Piyazi is far away in Jiechan State,

708
00:42:34,440 --> 00:42:35,599
so we don't have to worry about him.

709
00:42:35,960 --> 00:42:38,239
But Xiang Nan will be like a mad dog,

710
00:42:39,280 --> 00:42:41,039
refusing to let us go.

711
00:42:42,679 --> 00:42:45,599
Now you can get the goods straight from Jiechan State,

712
00:42:46,039 --> 00:42:46,760
while I

713
00:42:46,960 --> 00:42:50,239
have the most crucial clients on the mainland.

714
00:42:50,599 --> 00:42:51,679
If we partner up,

715
00:42:52,199 --> 00:42:54,719
making fast, big money won't be an issue.

716
00:42:55,039 --> 00:42:56,880
Only, if Xiang Nan finds out

717
00:42:56,960 --> 00:42:58,320
that we took over his market,

718
00:42:58,480 --> 00:43:00,400
he definitely won't let us off.

719
00:43:03,480 --> 00:43:04,320
As for Xiang Nan,

720
00:43:06,119 --> 00:43:07,079
what's your plan?

721
00:43:09,079 --> 00:43:11,920
I'd like to ask Boss Ma for a favor.

722
00:43:25,920 --> 00:43:26,800
Call Yang Xing.

723
00:43:26,880 --> 00:43:27,239
Yes, sir.

724
00:43:49,119 --> 00:43:49,920
Did everything go smoothly?

725
00:43:51,360 --> 00:43:52,760
This Cheng Weimin...

726
00:43:54,079 --> 00:43:56,000
used to be Xiang Nan's downline.

727
00:43:56,480 --> 00:43:57,079
Now,

728
00:43:57,079 --> 00:43:58,440
he wants to take his clients

729
00:43:58,440 --> 00:43:59,880
and work with us.

730
00:44:00,480 --> 00:44:01,360
But if he does that,

731
00:44:02,599 --> 00:44:04,239
Xiang Nan definitely won't let him off.

732
00:44:06,079 --> 00:44:06,840
So,

733
00:44:08,079 --> 00:44:11,000
he wants to use us to get rid of Xiang Nan.
